Hello! I'm the Mischievous Minigue! The life of the party.

I am in charge of the fun at the Children's Party. But chaos took over everything. All the party's sweets and gifts were stolen. Even my fine Tie got lost in all this.

My fine performance will be incomplete without my Tie.

Will you help me get my Tie back? I can help you with clues about the stolen whipped cream.

Please, bring the Tie and I will give you some whipped cream to take to Myu the Confectioner.
